{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"justjack420","id":"592252026226999306","is_bot":0,"username":"justjack420"},"author_id":"592252026226999306","channel_id":"746645778352832545","content":"New Item\nLectric Lasso\nWhip \n\nThis long flat cord of leather has a crackling arcane script along either side it’s length. You have +1 on attack rolls and damage. You can choose if the whip deals slashing or lightning damage. When you become attuned to this weapon you learn the Lightning Lure cantrip (Intelligence is your casting modifier). When you cast Lightning Lure using this weapon the range you can reach and the distance pulled are both doubled.","created_at":"2021-02-27T04:41:28.366000Z","edited_at":"2021-02-27T04:45:10.640000Z","id":"815081144676646952","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"746645778352832545","content":"Badberry\nLevel 1st\nCasting time 1 action\nRange Touch\nComponents VSM*\nDuration Instantanious\nSchool Necromancy\nAttack Save: Constituion\nDamage/Effect Healing/debuff\n\nUp to ten berries appear in your hand and are infused with necromantic magic for the duration. A creature can use its action to eat one berry. Eating a berry restores 5 hit point.  If the person eating the berry is not undead, they must make a CON saving throw.  If they fail, they lose 5 hit points from their max hp.  This loss can only be restored with a lesser restoration spell or greater.\n\nThe berries lose their potency if they have not been consumed within 24 hours of the casting of this spell.\n\nAt Higher Levels. When you cast this spell using a spell slot of 2nd level or higher, the hp gained, and max hp lost is increased by 2 for each slot level above 1st.\n* - (a sprig of rotten mistletoe)","created_at":"2021-02-27T20:27:23.122000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"815319191376756816","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
